WEBVTT

00:00:01.127 --> 00:00:03.462
Yoo-hoo! Jeremiah!

00:00:03.546 --> 00:00:05.923
[Kitty] Moon wears a pair
of AR-enhancement glasses

00:00:06.007 --> 00:00:10.177
that identify the people worth talking to
and the people who aren't.

00:00:10.261 --> 00:00:11.721
But-But I'm his aunt!

00:00:11.804 --> 00:00:16.392
[Kitty] 7Those who make the grade
earn a 60-second one-on-one with Mr. Moon.

00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:17.810
[Wolf] That's our window.

00:00:17.894 --> 00:00:19.145
[Kitty] Our only window.

00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:22.148
Once the ceremony begins, it's over.

00:00:22.231 --> 00:00:23.232
[device beeps]

00:00:24.567 --> 00:00:26.736
All right, everyone. I got eyes.

00:00:26.819 --> 00:00:28.362
Piranha, you're a go.

00:00:28.446 --> 00:00:29.947
-Hey, Clarence.
-Huh?

00:00:30.031 --> 00:00:31.908
Something doesn't look right
in this trunk.

00:00:31.991 --> 00:00:34.452
[Clarence] What is it? Let's see here.

00:00:34.535 --> 00:00:37.038
[Piranha] Oh, it's there.
It's there. Way in the back.

00:00:37.121 --> 00:00:38.331
Yeah. No, no, no. Keep--

00:00:38.414 --> 00:00:40.041
I think if you put your head in there...

00:00:40.124 --> 00:00:41.375
[groans]

00:00:41.459 --> 00:00:42.919
[Piranha] Oh, Clarence.

00:00:43.002 --> 00:00:44.295
[thrilling music continues]

00:00:44.378 --> 00:00:45.588
[security] All clear here.

00:00:46.923 --> 00:00:49.634
Titanium triple spring release.

00:00:49.717 --> 00:00:51.928
I've missed you, my old friend.

00:00:52.011 --> 00:00:54.305
[grunts, chokes]

00:00:55.056 --> 00:00:57.350
You're sure you still got this,
Snakey Cakes?

00:00:57.433 --> 00:01:00.853
Please. Lockpicking is like a romance.

00:01:00.937 --> 00:01:03.522
You gotta start gentle, playful,

00:01:03.606 --> 00:01:06.651
work your way into its little cold heart,

00:01:06.734 --> 00:01:09.195
until all those defenses...

00:01:09.278 --> 00:01:10.988
melt away.

00:01:11.072 --> 00:01:12.907
Oh. Sounds kinda fun.

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:14.825
-[Doom chuckles]
-[Snake chuckles]

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:17.411
Are we still talking about the lock?

00:01:20.373 --> 00:01:21.374
Huh?

00:01:22.124 --> 00:01:23.292
-A power outage?
-[knocking]

00:01:23.376 --> 00:01:25.962
Hello. Extremely quick electrician.

00:01:26.504 --> 00:01:28.297
Did someone call for an electrician?

00:01:28.381 --> 00:01:29.799
Yes, sir. That was me. She's all clear.

00:01:29.882 --> 00:01:31.300
Oops. Don't worry,

00:01:31.384 --> 00:01:34.011
I fix and be out
of your lip hair in no time.

00:01:34.095 --> 00:01:36.097
[Kitty] Al right, girls. Have fun.

00:01:38.599 --> 00:01:40.685
Name's Webs. I'll be your hacker today.

00:01:40.768 --> 00:01:41.769
[giggles]

00:01:43.312 --> 00:01:45.147
Mr. Wolf, that's your cue.

00:01:52.488 --> 00:01:54.240
[Texan accent] Don't spend it
all in one place, you hear?

00:01:54.323 --> 00:01:55.533
That's my job.

00:01:58.411 --> 00:02:00.913
<i>Hey. Afternoon. Howdy, ma'am.</i>

00:02:00.997 --> 00:02:03.582
Eyes up, cowboy. Your target's at 12:00.

00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:05.626
[Wolf] That's our man.

00:02:09.714 --> 00:02:12.216
What are you doing? Get in line.

00:02:12.299 --> 00:02:13.843
Buck Wolford doesn't do lines.

00:02:13.926 --> 00:02:15.302
[normal voice] Webs,
how's my cover ID?

00:02:15.386 --> 00:02:17.096
Hang tight, Wolfie.
Just a couple more firewalls.

00:02:17.179 --> 00:02:18.973
-Relax, Kitty, I got this.
-[Kitty] Wolf!

00:02:19.056 --> 00:02:21.517
[Texan accent]
Hey, excuse me. Mr. Moon, sir.

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:23.436
-Come on. Come on. Come on.
-[Kitty] Wolf.

00:02:23.519 --> 00:02:24.562
Bypass and boom!

00:02:27.523 --> 00:02:28.524
Careful, careful.

00:02:28.607 --> 00:02:31.986
Let's show our wealthy
and influential friend a little respect.

00:02:32.069 --> 00:02:33.612
-I thank you kindly.
-[sighs]

00:02:33.696 --> 00:02:35.948
-You still got it.
-[chuckles]

00:02:36.699 --> 00:02:38.909
[sighs] Now this is it.

00:02:38.993 --> 00:02:40.202
Swap the watch for the dummy.

00:02:40.286 --> 00:02:42.580
At least somebody's civilized around here.

00:02:42.663 --> 00:02:44.707
<i>My name's Buck Wolford. Big Bad Oil.</i>

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:46.375
But I'm sure you've heard of me.

00:02:46.459 --> 00:02:47.501
I am just so--

00:02:47.585 --> 00:02:48.836
Need a hand?

00:02:48.919 --> 00:02:51.005
Last I checked, you didn't have any.

00:02:51.088 --> 00:02:52.506
-[gasps]
-You never minded before.

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:54.175
-[Doom chuckles]
-[guest yells]

00:02:54.759 --> 00:02:55.968
-Oops.
-Oh, boy.

00:02:56.052 --> 00:02:58.846
Unless I'm mistaken, rockets do need oil.

00:02:58.929 --> 00:03:01.807
How'd you feel about
a strategic partnership, Mr. Moon?

00:03:01.891 --> 00:03:03.976
You're coming to me
with a business proposal

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:05.936
right before my wedding?

00:03:06.604 --> 00:03:10.232
You're a real operator,
Mr. Wolford. [laughs]

00:03:10.316 --> 00:03:12.068
You don't know the half of it.

00:03:13.235 --> 00:03:15.654
[tense music playing]

00:03:18.282 --> 00:03:21.327
Who authorized you to make eye contact?

00:03:26.624 --> 00:03:28.209
Oh, no, no, no, no, no.

00:03:28.292 --> 00:03:30.336
-Mr. Wolford?
-[Kitty] Gef the wafch!

00:03:30.419 --> 00:03:31.754
-[Soliman] Moon!
-[Moon] Ah!

00:03:31.837 --> 00:03:34.340
There's my Soli-wolly!
You're looking extra bald.

00:03:34.423 --> 00:03:36.509
And you're looking short. [laughs]

00:03:36.592 --> 00:03:37.843
Wolf.

00:03:40.179 --> 00:03:41.764
-Have we met before?
-Uh...

00:03:41.847 --> 00:03:44.141
No, no. I guess I just
have one of those faces.

00:03:44.225 --> 00:03:46.102
-Hey, anyway, Mr. Moon--
-Yeah, no, no.

00:03:46.185 --> 00:03:47.686
Did you take a pottery class in Sydney?

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:48.771
Sir, it's time.

00:03:48.854 --> 00:03:50.356
Ah, yes. Showtime!

00:03:50.439 --> 00:03:52.024
Wait a minute. Ho-- Excuse me, Mr.--

00:03:52.108 --> 00:03:53.859
-Can [/ just-- Mr. Moon--
-[roars]

00:03:53.943 --> 00:03:56.821
No, habibi, listen. I never forget a face.

00:03:56.904 --> 00:03:58.572
Naked high diving. Was it that?

00:03:58.656 --> 00:04:02.576
Oh, hi, yes. Can I borrow him
for just a moment?

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:04.370
-No. Okay.
-Thank you kindly.

00:04:04.453 --> 00:04:05.454
[both grunt]

00:04:05.538 --> 00:04:07.498
You blew the heist!

00:04:07.581 --> 00:04:10.376
[normal voice] That guy. I-I knew him,
and he was gonna recognize me.

00:04:10.459 --> 00:04:12.753
[Shark speaking Italian]

00:04:12.837 --> 00:04:14.296
Uh, we got a slight problem.

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:18.342
[slurring] Someone needs to tell Marco
that a shark ate him.

00:04:19.176 --> 00:04:21.053
Are you guys trying to sabotage this?

00:04:21.137 --> 00:04:22.638
-Who's ready to get married?
-[Shark yelps]

00:04:22.721 --> 00:04:24.473
[bell rings in slow motion]

00:04:25.057 --> 00:04:26.225
[crashes]

00:04:26.308 --> 00:04:27.143
-[priest groans]
-Shark!

00:04:27.226 --> 00:04:28.227
I'm a panicker.

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:29.520
This is all too much. You happy?

00:04:29.603 --> 00:04:31.522
I like this one.

00:04:31.605 --> 00:04:33.649
[groans] This whole thing's a bust!

00:04:33.732 --> 00:04:36.068
You lost your edge.

00:04:36.152 --> 00:04:38.028
And now the governor's gonna pay for it.

00:04:38.112 --> 00:04:40.197
Hey. Whoa, hey, let's not do
anything crazy, okay?

00:04:40.281 --> 00:04:41.282
We'll get you the watch.

00:04:41.365 --> 00:04:43.701
Oh, yeah? How?

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:47.788
[majestic music playing]

00:04:55.546 --> 00:04:58.007
It's like a freakin' fairy tale.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:00.092
[majestic music continues]

00:05:07.016 --> 00:05:09.643
Honey, you look so beautiful
in this dress.

00:05:14.565 --> 00:05:16.442
[grunts]

00:05:19.737 --> 00:05:21.739
"Big Bad Wolf"? Huh.

00:05:24.325 --> 00:05:26.619
-[snores]
-Shark, you're up.

00:05:33.792 --> 00:05:35.002
[clears throat]

00:05:36.295 --> 00:05:37.588
Welcome!

00:05:37.671 --> 00:05:42.384
Welcome to this most
beautifious, majestacular,

00:05:42.468 --> 00:05:44.511
incredimonious occasion.

00:05:44.595 --> 00:05:47.264
Whoo! Whoo!

00:05:47.348 --> 00:05:48.724
Whoo!

00:05:48.807 --> 00:05:51.227
Could he be a little more subtle?

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:52.937
-For Shark, this is subtle.
-[Shark] Whoo!

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:54.355
Give it to me real good.

00:05:54.438 --> 00:05:57.441
We stand here today to marry this man.

00:05:57.524 --> 00:06:01.737
This manly, masculine,
manleously maleful man

00:06:02.529 --> 00:06:06.158
and this totally normal woman
in the sacra-nimonius bonds...

00:06:06.242 --> 00:06:07.159
What?

00:06:07.243 --> 00:06:10.412
...of holy matriminimamony. Whoo!

00:06:10.496 --> 00:06:13.332
[clears throat] Now,
would you please join hands.

